    "origin_id": "https://www.biospace.com/drug-development/j-j-and-protagonists-icotyde-improves-psoriatic-arthritis-but-abbvies-skyrizi-likely-to-reign/#article",
    "canonical_url": "https://www.biospace.com/drug-development/j-j-and-protagonists-icotyde-improves-psoriatic-arthritis-but-abbvies-skyrizi-likely-to-reign",
